        d = new PhaseItem(ColorKt.f11469j, "PMS", 2131234628, "According to ACOG, many women feel physical or mood changes during the days before menstruation. When these symptoms happen every month, and they affect a woman’s normal life, they are known as premenstrual syndrome (PMS).", "View your PMS stage", new i(19));
